{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17409","headline":"德宗神武孝文皇帝挽歌词三首 三 · 权德舆","name":"德宗神武孝文皇帝挽歌词三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常时柏梁宴，今日谷林归。\n玉斝恩波徧，灵輼烟雨霏。\n乔山森羽骑，渭水拥旌旗。\n仙驭何由见，耘田鸟自飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17409.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17409","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}